{"id":"kurz","lemma":"kurz","pos":"adj","rank":295,"glosses":["short, quick, brief","short","short, concise, succinct (of words or writing)"],"ipa":"/kʊʁt͡s/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d8/De-kurz.ogg/De-kurz.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"kürzer","superlative":"am kürzesten"},"formAudio":{"kürzer":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d6/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Natschoba-k%C3%BCrzer.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich weiß, das Leben ist kurz.","en":"I know life is short.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/40860","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"a state in which…"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Welcher Weg wohl kürzer ist?","en":"I wonder which way is faster.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/698718","words":[{"g":"which"},{"g":"away"},{"g":"possibly, probably"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Seine Rede war zu kurz.","en":"His speech was too short.","words":[{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},{"g":"speech, address"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"to / too"},null]},{"text":"Kannst du das kurz erklären?","en":"Can you explain it briefly?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"to explain"}]},{"text":"Im Winter sind die Tage kürzer.","en":"In the winter, days are shorter.","words":[{"g":"in the"},{"g":"winter"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"in the coming days"]]}]}